# Transactions

**2026 household cashbook \| two-income household**

The ledger covers take-home salary, freelance receipts and regular household spending across the full year. Salary increases take effect in July; summer and holiday travel are budgeted separately. All amounts are dollars.

Transactions are recorded when paid. Transfers to savings are excluded from spending so the monthly surplus can be allocated without double counting.

