# Monthly Summary

**Monthly savings and reserve build-up**

The year starts with $12,000 in savings. Surplus is retained in the reserve account; the six-month emergency target covers housing, transport, utilities and healthcare. The July pay rise is reserved for saving rather than a higher recurring spending baseline.

